WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.117 --> 00:00:04.536
- One, two, three, four,
five, six, seven, and eight

00:00:04.536 --> 00:00:07.126
and back to the fifth.

00:00:07.126 --> 00:00:08.520
Good, let's try it again.

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:09.959
From the beginning.

00:00:09.959 --> 00:00:11.873
- My name is Davon Kibble
and I will be doing ballet

00:00:11.873 --> 00:00:13.275
with my daughter Chloe.

00:00:13.275 --> 00:00:15.528
- When I found out I
was going to have a girl

00:00:15.528 --> 00:00:16.688
I was very excited.

00:00:16.688 --> 00:00:18.140
She was my only girl.

00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:21.165
I have three boys, so this just completed

00:00:21.165 --> 00:00:22.586
the process for me.

00:00:22.586 --> 00:00:24.377
- It is important for me
to be here with my daughter

00:00:24.377 --> 00:00:25.996
so I can show her how much I love her

00:00:25.996 --> 00:00:28.650
and that I'm always going
to be there for her,

00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:29.549
no matter what.

00:00:29.549 --> 00:00:30.831
Even if it's ballet dancing.

00:00:30.831 --> 00:00:32.235
- My dad can dance.

00:00:32.235 --> 00:00:36.402
He has some moves that are
pretty hard for me to accomplish.

00:00:38.597 --> 00:00:39.430
- Ready, go.

00:00:39.430 --> 00:00:40.989
(music)

00:00:40.989 --> 00:00:42.183
- My name is La Toya Bellamy.

00:00:42.183 --> 00:00:44.350
I am the artistic director and founder

00:00:44.350 --> 00:00:46.099
of Dancer 4 Life, L.A. dance studio.

00:00:46.099 --> 00:00:48.857
I've been dancing for 32 years.

00:00:48.857 --> 00:00:50.609
I started with ballet of course.

00:00:50.609 --> 00:00:52.575
I decided to open up a dance a studio

00:00:52.575 --> 00:00:55.355
when I turned 15 and watching my teachers,

00:00:55.355 --> 00:00:56.718
I was like, "Oh, I can do this."

00:00:56.718 --> 00:00:59.710
And within six months,
I became the teacher,

00:00:59.710 --> 00:01:02.371
the choreographer, the
director of the class.

00:01:02.371 --> 00:01:05.236
Growing up I was like,
I want to do this myself

00:01:05.236 --> 00:01:08.511
and my dance studio has
been open for five years.

00:01:08.511 --> 00:01:12.267
I was blessed and now I
am growing and growing

00:01:12.267 --> 00:01:15.874
and excited to teach my
dancers ages two and up.

00:01:15.874 --> 00:01:17.137
- Alright, you ready to do some ballet?

00:01:17.137 --> 00:01:18.449
- I don't know.

00:01:18.449 --> 00:01:19.735
- You're supposed to say yes!

00:01:19.735 --> 00:01:21.064
I've got tights on and everything.

00:01:21.064 --> 00:01:22.152
- Okay

00:01:22.152 --> 00:01:22.985
(laughs)

00:01:22.985 --> 00:01:24.525
- Hi daughters and dads.
- [Dads] Hello

00:01:24.525 --> 00:01:25.952
- [La Toya] Welcome to the first day

00:01:25.952 --> 00:01:28.818
of daddy daughter ballet.

00:01:28.818 --> 00:01:29.651
You guys excited?

00:01:29.651 --> 00:01:30.519
- [Dads and Daughters] Yes!

00:01:30.519 --> 00:01:31.352
- Awesome.

00:01:31.352 --> 00:01:32.559
So we're going to do some pirouettes.

00:01:32.559 --> 00:01:34.151
So you're going to look for
a diamond between your legs.

00:01:34.151 --> 00:01:36.150
- Bend your arms. Bend them.

00:01:36.150 --> 00:01:38.130
- [Davon] Oh, like that, okay.

00:01:38.130 --> 00:01:40.963
- Arms are going to come up and pirouette.

00:01:40.963 --> 00:01:42.500
Good, and stretch.

00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:45.901
- I thought I prepared myself
and stretched a little before,

00:01:45.901 --> 00:01:48.806
but apparently we have
to go a little deeper.

00:01:48.806 --> 00:01:49.639
(instrumental music)

00:01:49.639 --> 00:01:52.414
- Daughters take your right
leg, put it on top of the bar.

00:01:52.414 --> 00:01:54.058
Dads can go right behind them please.

00:01:54.058 --> 00:01:55.103
- [Dad] Oh, okay.

00:01:55.103 --> 00:01:56.087
- Let's try it, there you go.

00:01:56.087 --> 00:01:56.920
- Oh, shucks.

00:01:56.920 --> 00:01:58.654
- [La Toya] Good, now John behind Allie.

00:01:58.654 --> 00:01:59.489
- Alright.

00:01:59.489 --> 00:02:00.912
(girl squeals)

00:02:00.912 --> 00:02:02.522
- [La Toya] Awesome.
Are your feet pointed?

00:02:02.522 --> 00:02:04.977
There you go. Very good.

00:02:04.977 --> 00:02:06.077
All the way over.

00:02:06.077 --> 00:02:07.810
Good. Good. Stretch it out.

00:02:07.810 --> 00:02:09.310
Feel that stretch.

00:02:10.505 --> 00:02:12.089
- Over here. Over here.

00:02:12.089 --> 00:02:14.724
(instrumental music)

00:02:14.724 --> 00:02:15.557
- [La Toya] There we go.

00:02:15.557 --> 00:02:16.390
- Point.

00:02:19.853 --> 00:02:20.686
- I got it?

00:02:20.686 --> 00:02:21.770
- I was just making sure the teacher

00:02:21.770 --> 00:02:24.333
went easy on us first-timers here.

00:02:24.333 --> 00:02:26.360
- Alright, we're going to have
a seat in butterfly position.

00:02:26.360 --> 00:02:28.197
Please have a seat.

00:02:28.197 --> 00:02:29.166
- What is "butterfly position"?

00:02:29.166 --> 00:02:30.683
- Put your feet together.

00:02:30.683 --> 00:02:31.516
- Oh, okay.
- Feet together.

00:02:31.516 --> 00:02:32.699
- So daughters, help your dads out.

00:02:32.699 --> 00:02:35.989
Make sure their feet are
in the correct position.

00:02:35.989 --> 00:02:36.822
- [Melia] There we go.

00:02:36.822 --> 00:02:37.655
- Okay.

00:02:37.655 --> 00:02:38.977
- [Melia] You just hold it right here.

00:02:38.977 --> 00:02:39.810
- Alright.

00:02:39.810 --> 00:02:40.643
- Like this?

00:02:40.643 --> 00:02:41.513
- Yes, go up and down.

00:02:41.513 --> 00:02:42.371
- Up and down?

00:02:42.371 --> 00:02:43.204
- [La Toya] Up and down, yes.

00:02:43.204 --> 00:02:44.037
You're correct.

00:02:44.037 --> 00:02:45.303
Legs up and down. Awesome.

00:02:45.303 --> 00:02:46.515
Now stretch all the way
over into your butterfly,

00:02:46.515 --> 00:02:48.498
head down to your toes.

00:02:48.498 --> 00:02:49.331
- Oh

00:02:49.331 --> 00:02:50.164
(Chloe laughs)

00:02:50.164 --> 00:02:52.133
- That's as far as I go, Miss L.

00:02:52.133 --> 00:02:55.468
- So you want to come
up on your left feet.

00:02:55.468 --> 00:02:57.677
Make sure one hand is on
each side of that leg.

00:02:57.677 --> 00:03:00.496
- I should have did a few
extra stretches myself.

00:03:00.496 --> 00:03:01.664
I needed help with that left leg.

00:03:01.664 --> 00:03:02.592
(dads laugh)

00:03:02.592 --> 00:03:03.425
- Told you.

00:03:03.425 --> 00:03:05.675
- Look, told you (laughs)

00:03:05.675 --> 00:03:07.705
- [La Toya] And slide as far as we can.

00:03:07.705 --> 00:03:09.364
- Stretching all the way.

00:03:09.364 --> 00:03:11.122
- That's it, that's it (laughs).

00:03:11.122 --> 00:03:12.512
- [Chloe] Daddy, go back further.

00:03:12.512 --> 00:03:13.345
- I can't.

00:03:13.345 --> 00:03:14.178
- [La Toya] Yeah, dad.

00:03:14.178 --> 00:03:15.595
- Good job daddy.

00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:17.732
- Point your toes.

00:03:17.732 --> 00:03:18.734
- No.

00:03:18.734 --> 00:03:20.837
- I feel I did pretty okay.

00:03:20.837 --> 00:03:22.828
I have a new respect for all dancers.

00:03:22.828 --> 00:03:24.666
- [La Toya] Alright guys,
ready. We're going to go across.

00:03:24.666 --> 00:03:26.237
We're going to do some jetés.

00:03:26.237 --> 00:03:27.190
- [Dad] Jeté?

00:03:27.190 --> 00:03:28.788
- Yes, we're going to
start with the sashay.

00:03:28.788 --> 00:03:32.250
So, right leg and you're
going to step together,

00:03:32.250 --> 00:03:33.903
and then step and then jump.

00:03:33.903 --> 00:03:34.902
- [Davon] Step

00:03:34.902 --> 00:03:35.735
- [La Toya] Jump

00:03:35.735 --> 00:03:36.568
- [Devon] Jump

00:03:36.568 --> 00:03:37.468
- [La Toya] Jump

00:03:37.468 --> 00:03:39.147
Good, arabesque.

00:03:39.147 --> 00:03:40.532
- Little bit uncomfortable.

00:03:40.532 --> 00:03:43.488
Something felt a bit weird.

00:03:43.488 --> 00:03:45.609
- [La Toya] Jump. Jeté.

00:03:45.609 --> 00:03:46.959
Good, arabesque.

00:03:46.959 --> 00:03:51.254
- I think the jetés were a
little difficult to begin with.

00:03:51.254 --> 00:03:53.000
- [La Toya] And, sashay.

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:55.000
And jeté....jeté...jeté.

00:03:56.104 --> 00:03:58.135
Good, arabesque.

00:03:58.135 --> 00:04:02.409
- My favorite part was
when we did choreography.

00:04:02.409 --> 00:04:05.429
- Alright, girls, dads,
you ready for some choreo?

00:04:05.429 --> 00:04:06.373
- [Dads and daughters] Yes!

00:04:06.373 --> 00:04:07.306
- Alright.

00:04:07.306 --> 00:04:09.942
- [Girl] I really liked
when my dad picked me up.

00:04:09.942 --> 00:04:11.468
[Dad] Was glad that I was able to catch on

00:04:11.468 --> 00:04:12.737
to the choreography.

00:04:12.737 --> 00:04:15.545
- [John] Standing on my
toes is difficult (laughs)

00:04:15.545 --> 00:04:16.378
- Wooo

00:04:16.378 --> 00:04:17.211
(dads and daughters laugh)

00:04:17.211 --> 00:04:19.711
- You gotta go there.

00:04:19.711 --> 00:04:21.966
- [Melia] I'm too tall.

00:04:21.966 --> 00:04:23.432
- You guys ready to perform it?

00:04:23.432 --> 00:04:24.265
- [Dads And Daughters] Yes!

00:04:24.265 --> 00:04:26.075
- Yes, alright. Let's do this!

00:04:26.075 --> 00:04:29.992
(instrumental classical music)

00:04:59.950 --> 00:05:01.168
- How did I do Ari?

00:05:01.168 --> 00:05:02.001
- Great!

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:05.046
I think my dad did really great.

00:05:05.046 --> 00:05:06.915
- I did my dad did amazing.

00:05:06.915 --> 00:05:09.638
- I think my dad did outstanding.

00:05:09.638 --> 00:05:11.271
- You know what, I enjoyed it.

00:05:11.271 --> 00:05:12.230
I'm just glad that I was able

00:05:12.230 --> 00:05:14.042
to catch on to the choreography.

00:05:14.042 --> 00:05:17.826
- I would say to all the
dads out there, get involved.

00:05:17.826 --> 00:05:21.074
Enjoy your daughters as
much as you possibly can

00:05:21.074 --> 00:05:23.324
while they're little girls.

